{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"I have been here for an hour; I drove here in good company. I am here beyond the German border, but not yet within the French one; nor is even that exact, for this part of the Netherlands still belongs to the German Confederation. — I am returning tired from a walk that Mr. von Hanfstengel led me on, through the town and a part of the fortifications. The latter are admirable, so that I can see it too; — I have registered for the diligence to Metz and will depart there tomorrow morning, and from there it goes on to the real goal of the journey, to which the previous part was the preludes. You see that I am not exaggerating. The physical fatigues are not significant, the mental ones consist in the lack of business and the lack of conversation with you, in contrast to a conversation with insignificant company; yet this also goes quite well overall; a good Brabantine from Louvain, who had made a tour to the Rhine to distract himself from the recently suffered loss of a son of 21 years and a daughter of 17 years, was today with us in our diligence, a composed, restrained man, who invited me to visit him in Louvain."}}],"created":1795220903,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":254,"prompt_tokens":371,"total_tokens":625,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-NYR0JtkwFkta0eENHmadro0rLXSwwDs3","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":371,"prompt_ms":497.907,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.3420673854447438,"prompt_per_second":745.1190684204078,"predicted_n":254,"predicted_ms":5985.671,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.658778656126483,"predicted_per_second":42.26760876098937}}